WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
On a distant, quiet world, a rover takes historic steps across the rust-red soil of Mars.

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.660
Dust particles swirl in the thin atmosphere as the rover presses forward into uncharted territory.

3
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.990
Beneath the distant sun, the vast planetary expanse stretches into eternity, breathtaking and profound.

